# Firebase config — kept out of git deliberately (Phase 10/13 decision,
# 00_MASTER_PLAN.md §4): technically shippable, but not committed. Each
# dev/CI environment places its own copy; the API key inside is
# domain/package-restricted, not a bearer secret, but the file still
# shouldn't live in the repo.
/android/app/google-services.json
/ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist
